  #line-at(70.86pt, 185.6pt, "Once trapped, the fraction of positrons that annihilate with valence electrons results in a ")
  #line-at(70.86pt, 206.3pt, "narrower energy distribution of the 511 keV gamma-ray peak. The width of this distribution is ")
  #line-at(70.86pt, 227pt, "quantified by the S parameter, a lineshape parameter representing annihilation with low-")
  #line-at(70.86pt, 247.7pt, "momentum electrons and serving as a sensitive indicator of defect density. To assess the initial ")
  #line-at(70.86pt, 268.4pt, "depth distribution of implanted positrons, stopping profiles were calculated using the ")
