  #line-at(70.86pt, 610.3pt, "As shown in Figs.  12 a-d, during the intermediate stage, different types of interstitial ")
  #line-at(70.86pt, 630.94pt, "configurations, such as single, doublets, and triplets, are formed, along with Frenkel pair ")
