  #line-at(70.86pt, 672.34pt, "matrix interface. This accumulation contributes to the shrinkage of the pre-existing void. ")
  #line-at(70.86pt, 701.1pt, "By the final stage, the number of interstitials and Frenkel pairs has significantly decreased, ")
