  #line-at(70.86pt, 82.08pt, "on the other hand, results in peak damage levels centered at approximately 1060 nm. The ")
  #line-at(70.86pt, 102.78pt, "corresponding C ion concentrations are relatively low, about 0.13 at% for the 2 × 10")
